### Key Integration Code Snippets

#### A. PayFast ITN Handler (in `inc/payfast-itn-handler.php`)
```php
add_action('woocommerce_api_wc_gateway_payfast', 'ngt_handle_payfast_itn');

function ngt_handle_payfast_itn() {
    // Verify ITN signature (critical for security)
    $payload = file_get_contents('php://input');
    $signature = $_SERVER['HTTP_X_PAYFAST_SIGNATURE'] ?? '';
    $passphrase = NGT_PAYFAST_PASSPHRASE;

    if (!ngt_verify_payfast_signature($payload, $signature, $passphrase)) {
        wp_die('Invalid signature', 'PayFast Error', 403);
    }

    parse_str($payload, $data);

    // Only process completed payments
    if ($data['payment_status'] !== 'COMPLETE') return;

    $order_id = $data['order_id'];
    $order = wc_get_order($order_id);

    // Record earnings in custom table
    ngt_record_earnings_from_order($order);

    // Trigger n8n webhook for heavy processing
    ngt_trigger_n8n_workflow('payment.completed', [
        'order_id' => $order_id,
        'customer_id' => $order->get_customer_id(),
        'amount' => $order->get_total(),
        'items' => $order->get_items()
    ]);

    // Log for audit
    error_log("PayFast ITN processed for order #{$order_id}");
}

function ngt_verify_payfast_signature($payload, $signature, $passphrase) {
    // PayFast signature algorithm: md5 of sorted params + passphrase
    parse_str($payload, $data);
    ksort($data);
    $pfParamString = http_build_query($data);
    $computed = md5($pfParamString . $passphrase);
    return hash_equals($computed, $signature);
}
```

#### B. n8n Webhook Receiver (in `inc/n8n-webhook-receiver.php`)
```php
// Register custom REST endpoint
add_action('rest_api_init', function() {
    register_rest_route('ngt/v1', '/webhooks/n8n', [
        'methods' => 'POST',
        'callback' => 'ngt_handle_n8n_webhook',
        'permission_callback' => '__return_true', // Signature check inside
    ]);
});

function ngt_handle_n8n_webhook(WP_REST_Request $request) {
    $payload = $request->get_json_params();
    $signature = $request->get_header('X-N8N-Signature');
    $secret = defined('NGT_N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET') ? NGT_N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET : '';

    // Verify HMAC signature
    if (!hash_equals(hash_hmac('sha256', json_encode($payload), $secret), $signature)) {
        return new WP_Error('invalid_signature', 'Unauthorized', ['status' => 401]);
    }

    // Route by event type
    switch ($payload['event'] ?? '') {
        case 'payment.completed':
            ngt_process_payment_completed($payload['data']);
            break;
        case 'session.completed':
            ngt_process_session_completed($payload['data']);
            break;
        case 'payout.processed':
            ngt_log_payout_confirmation($payload['data']);
            break;
    }

    return ['status' => 'received'];
}
```

#### C. AutomatorWP → n8n Handoff (Avoid Duplication)
```php
// In functions-enhanced.php: Only use AutomatorWP for lightweight WordPress-native triggers
add_action('automatorwp_amelia_session_completed', function($session_id) {
