### Caching Strategy for Shared Hosting
```php
// Cache tutor dashboard data (1 hour)
function ngt_get_cached_tutor_dashboard($tutor_id) {
    $key = "ngt_dashboard_tutor_{$tutor_id}";
    $data = wp_cache_get($key, 'ngt');

    if (false === $data) {
        $data = ngt_generate_tutor_dashboard_data($tutor_id);
        wp_cache_set($key, $data, 'ngt', 3600);
