## 📅 1. Amelia Service & Employee Setup (Exact WP Admin Steps)

Amelia does **not** handle platform fee splits or payout calculations natively. It serves as the **booking & availability engine**. Payments route through WooCommerce → PayFast → Custom Earnings Table. Follow these exact steps:

