`WP Admin → Amelia → Services → Add Service`
| Service Name | Category | Duration | Price (Client) | Notes |
|--------------|----------|----------|----------------|-------|
| `Online - Tier 1 (1-3mo)` | Math/Science | 60 min | `R320` | Default for new clients |
| `Online - Tier 2 (3-12mo)` | Math/Science | 60 min | `R300` | Auto-applied after 3mo |
| `In-Person - Tier 1` | Math/Science | 60 min | `R350` | Tutor travels |
