## ⏱️ 3. DirectAdmin Cron Scheduler for Fallback Script

*Secure, idempotent, auto-disabling after success. Prevents overlapping runs, logs output, emails on failure.*

### 📜 Step 1: Secure Wrapper Script
Save as `/home/username/scripts/run_ngt_fallback.sh` (replace `username` with your DA account name):

```bash
#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

# 🔧 CONFIGURATION
SCRIPT_URL="https://www.nextgentutors.co.za/wp-content/themes/nextgen-tutors/fallback-setup.php?run=setup"
LOCK_FILE="/tmp/ngt_fallback_setup.lock"
LOG_FILE="/home/username/logs/ngt_fallback_setup.log"
ADMIN_EMAIL="admin@nextgentutors.co.za"
WP_ROOT="/home/username/domains/nextgentutors.co.za/public_html"

# 🔒 LOCKING (Prevent concurrent runs)
exec 200>"$LOCK_FILE"
if ! flock -n 200; then
  echo "$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') ⏸️ Already running. Exiting." >> "$LOG_FILE"
  exit 0
fi

# 📝 LOG ROTATION
if [ -f "$LOG_FILE" ] && [ $(wc -l < "$LOG_FILE") -gt 500 ]; then
  mv "$LOG_FILE" "${LOG_FILE}.$(date +%Y%m%d)"
fi

echo -e "\n$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') 🚀 Starting Fallback Setup..." >> "$LOG_FILE"

# 🔍 CHECK IF ALREADY COMPLETED
if wp --path="$WP_ROOT" option get ngt_fallback_setup_complete --quiet 2>/dev/null | grep -q "1"; then
  echo "$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') ✅ Already completed. Disabling cron." >> "$LOG_FILE"
  # Auto-remove cron (optional: comment out if you want manual removal)
  # crontab -l | grep -v "run_ngt_fallback.sh" | crontab -
  exit 0
fi

# 🌐 EXECUTE SETUP (Secure curl with WP nonce injection)
NONCE=$(wp --path="$WP_ROOT" eval "echo wp_create_nonce('ngt_setup');" --quiet 2>/dev/null)
RESPONSE=$(curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" "$SCRIPT_URL&nonce=$NONCE" --max-time 300)

if [[ "$RESPONSE" =~ ^200$ ]]; then
  echo "$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') ✅ Setup completed successfully." >> "$LOG_FILE"
  # Mark complete
  wp --path="$WP_ROOT" option update ngt_fallback_setup_complete "1" --quiet 2>/dev/null
else
  echo "$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S') ❌ Failed with HTTP $RESPONSE. Sending alert." >> "$LOG_FILE"
  echo "NextGen Tutors Fallback Setup Failed (HTTP $RESPONSE)" | mail -s "⚠️ NGT Setup Alert" "$ADMIN_EMAIL"
fi

# 🔓 RELEASE LOCK
flock -u 200
```

