Template: smarthead
Version: 1.0.0
Description: Child theme for NextGen Tutors platform
*/
```

### 2. PayFast Configuration (Critical Path)
PayFast requires precise ITN (Instant Transaction Notification) setup for order confirmation [[16]][[17]]:

```php
// wp-config.php additions (NEVER store in DB)
define('NGT_PAYFAST_MERCHANT_ID', '10000100');
define('NGT_PAYFAST_MERCHANT_KEY', '46f0cd694581a');
define('NGT_PAYFAST_PASSPHRASE', 'your-secure-passphrase');
define('NGT_PAYFAST_SANDBOX', true); // Set false for production
define('NGT_PAYFAST_ITN_URL', 'https://www.nextgentutors.co.za/?wc-api=WC_Gateway_Payfast');
```

**WooCommerce → Settings → Payments → PayFast**:
- ✅ Enable PayFast
- ✅ Enable Logging (for debugging)
- ✅ ITN Notify URL: `https://www.nextgentutors.co.za/?wc-api=WC_Gateway_Payfast`
- ✅ Security Passphrase: Match wp-config.php value

> 🔐 **Test in Sandbox First**: Use PayFast's developer credentials. Merchant IDs differ between sandbox/live [[12]][[17]].

### 3. DirectAdmin PHP Optimization
Shared hosting needs careful tuning [[37]][[40]][[44]]:

```ini
