## 🛡️ Security & Compliance Checklist (All Enforced)
- ✅ All SQL uses `$wpdb->prepare()`
- ✅ All inputs sanitized (`sanitize_text_field`, `sanitize_email`, `esc_url_raw`)
- ✅ All outputs escaped (`esc_html`, `esc_attr` in templates)
- ✅ Bearer tokens hashed via `wp_hash()` before DB storage
- ✅ Bank data encrypted via `openssl_encrypt` (`AES-256-CBC`)
- ✅ HMAC-SHA256 for n8n, MD5+passphrase for PayFast
- ✅ Rate limiting (60 req/hr) + replay protection (300s window)
- ✅ POPIA consent required on registration, IP & timestamp logged
