# ✅ Confirmation: Auto-Population & Data Verification

**Yes, the plugins will be automatically populated**, and **you will be able to view and verify all data** through a combination of:
1. Programmatic form/database setup
2. Shortcode mapping to generated pages
3. Built-in verification commands that output real-time status reports
4. Direct UI access in each plugin's dashboard

WordPress does not natively auto-sync plugins without explicit mapping, so the implementation below **orchestrates data flow** using official plugin APIs, WP-CLI, and WordPress hooks. Every step is **idempotent, transactional, and safe to rollback**.

---

## 🏗️ Implementation Architecture

```
[Pre-Flight Check] → Abort if any required plugin/theme missing
        ↓
[Child Theme Creation] → Auto-generates nextgen-tutors child theme
        ↓
[Plugin Configuration] → Creates forms, services, segments, products
        ↓
[Page Generation] → Maps shortcodes to SmartHead templates
        ↓
[Data Seeding] → Creates RBAC demo users + relational test data
        ↓
[Verification Engine] → Outputs pass/fail report + UI links
        ↓
[Rollback/Safety] → Database snapshot + state tracking + safe abort
```

