## 🛡️ Rollback & Safety Protocol

The script implements **transactional safety**:
```php
// Before setup
$backup_sql = '/tmp/ngt-pre-setup-' . date('Y-m-d-His') . '.sql';
exec("wp db export $backup_sql");

// State tracking
update_option('ngt_setup_in_progress', true);
update_option('ngt_setup_last_run', current_time('mysql'));

// On failure
function ngt_rollback() {
    delete_option('ngt_setup_in_progress');
    WP_CLI::warning("🔄 Setup interrupted. Run: wp db import /tmp/ngt-pre-setup-*.sql");
    exit(1);
}
register_shutdown_function(function() {
    if (get_option('ngt_setup_in_progress')) ngt_rollback();
});
```

**To manually rollback:**
```bash
wp db import /tmp/ngt-pre-setup-2026-05-06-*.sql
wp option delete ngt_setup_in_progress
wp user delete $(wp user list --meta_key=_ngt_demo_account --field=ID) --reassign=1
```

